# Secrets & local env — never bake into images
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/.env
**/.env.local

# VCS / IDE
.git
.gitignore
.cursor
.vscode
.idea

# Dependencies & build
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.venv
**/venv
**/dist
**/build
mobile/

# Docs / local clutter not needed at runtime
*.md
!README.md
PUBLISH_CHECKLIST.md
